# the cases this column serves: a case name or glob per line, then the reason.
# riscv64-linux with Zfh selected changes codegen only by computing f16 on the
# f registers, an f16 lane included, so the column serves the f16 cases and
# nothing else: every other case would repeat riscv64-linux.

float/f16_*     the Zfh arithmetic, comparisons and integer conversions, and the Zfhmin conversions (#3801).
vec/rows_f16    the f16 lanes, each the Zfh scalar operation (#3802).
vec/cast_lanes  the f16 lane conversions, each the Zfh or Zfhmin scalar one (#3802).
